      "instance_name": "two_muscular_arms",
      "label": "human body parts",
      "description": "Two muscular arms are locked in an arm-wrestling match, positioned centrally in the image. The arms are taut and appear to be exerting force against each other, symbolizing a physical struggle or competition. This is the primary visual element and the focus of the meme's metaphor.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
