      "instance_name": "lgbtq_plus_stigma",
      "label": "LGBTQ+ Stigma",
      "description": "The meme perpetuates the dangerous and false stereotype that HIV/AIDS is inherently tied to gay men, which has been used historically to stigmatize and blame the LGBTQ+ community. This stigma contributes to discrimination and marginalization of gay men and people living with HIV/AIDS.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
