      "instance_name": "mapping_aids_arm",
      "label": "aids is mapped to the left arm",
      "description": "The text 'aids' is positioned directly over the left muscular arm in the arm-wrestling match, creating an analogical mapping where the concept of 'aids' is visually represented by that arm. This mapping is part of the meme's false equivalence stereotype, implying a direct conflict or rivalry between HIV/AIDS and gay men.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
